---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import LegalIdentity from '../../components/LegalIdentity.astro';
import { AUTHOR_NAME, CLARITY_ID, CONTACT_EMAIL, GA4_ID, LAST_UPDATED, LEGAL, SITE_NAMES, SITE_URL } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title={`Legal notice – ${SITE_NAMES[lang]}`} description="Publisher, publication director, host, intellectual property, reuse of the Italian speed-camera register and ISTAT data, limits of liability and governing law." lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Legal notice' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <h1>Legal notice</h1>
    <p>Information published under article 6 III-1 of French law no. 2004-575 of 21 June 2004 on confidence in the digital economy (LCEN).</p>
    <h2>Publisher</h2>
    <LegalIdentity lang={lang} />
    <p>Publication director: {AUTHOR_NAME}, responsible for the content published on {SITE_URL}.</p>
    <h2>Host</h2>
    <LegalIdentity mode="hosting" lang={lang} />
    <h2>Purpose of the site and no advice</h2>
    <p>The site works out free of charge, from the visitor’s inputs, the penalty the Italian texts set for a traffic offence (speed held, amount within 5 and 60 days, points, suspension), the payment and appeal deadlines and an estimate of the points balance, and presents the national register of speed-measuring devices by comune. These results are not legal advice, a decision or personal guidance: only the fine received, or a decision of the prefetto or the court, is binding. The site is independent: it is affiliated with no Italian ministry, police force, prefettura or comune, nor with any law firm, appeal service or insurer, and uses no official logo. Method and limits: <a href={route('method', lang)}>method</a>.</p>
    <h2>Reused data</h2>
    <p>Speed-measuring devices: “Lista dispositivi di rilevamento della velocità” of the Italian Ministry of Infrastructure and Transport (velox.mit.gov.it), reused under the <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/it/legalcode" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 Italy</a> licence stated in the <a href="https://www.mit.gov.it/note-legali" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">legal notes of mit.gov.it</a>, with the source and the date of the copy shown; each device has been attached by the publisher to its comune, and its type read from the body’s own notes. Comuni: ISTAT list of codes, under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">CC BY 4.0</a>. Rules: the Highway Code, its Regulation and legislative decree 150/2011 as published on Normattiva; legislative and regulatory texts are not covered by copyright (article 5 of Italian law 633 of 1941).</p>
    <h2>Limits of liability</h2>
    <p>Data is read automatically and checked, with no guarantee of being error-free or always available. The publisher cannot be held liable for a decision taken solely on the basis of an amount or date shown here. Errors can be reported through the <a href={route('contact', lang)}>contact</a> page.</p>
    <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>Text, graphics and code are protected and remain the publisher’s property; short quotations are allowed with a link to the original page. Reused public data keep their own licences, stated above.</p>
    <h2>Embedding the tool</h2><p>The fine calculator can be embedded free as an iframe, keeping the visible link: see the <a href={route('widget', lang)}>embed page</a>.</p>
    {/* gen-legal-pages:terms */}
    <h2>Personal data and cookies</h2>
    {GA4_ID ? (<p>What you type in the calculators stays in your browser. The site sets Google Analytics audience measurement cookies (<code>_ga</code>, <code>_ga_{GA4_ID.replace('G-', '')}</code>, 13 months at most), with no advertising{CLARITY_ID && '; page stability is monitored with Microsoft Clarity, cookie-free'}. Details, legal basis and how to object: <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a> and <a href={route('cookies', lang)}>cookies</a> page.</p>) : (<p>What you type in the calculators stays in your browser and the site sets no cookies{CLARITY_ID && '; page stability is monitored anonymously with Microsoft Clarity, cookie-free'}. See the <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a> and the <a href={route('cookies', lang)}>cookies</a> page.</p>)}
    {/* /gen-legal-pages:terms */}
    <h2>Reporting</h2><p>Unlawful content: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>, with the page address and the reason.</p>
    <h2>Governing law</h2><p>French law, the publisher being established in France. Failing an amicable settlement, the competent courts of {LEGAL.jurisdiction}. Updated: {LAST_UPDATED}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
